      "content": "hey so i get these really bad migraines sometimes where i get weird vision stuff and a headache. but this one feels way more intense and my left arm feels kinda heavy and weak... plus my vision is all blurry in just my left eye. is this just a really bad migraine aura or something? i'm kind of scared to go to the er if it's just a migraine",
