      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your hesitation about the ER, but the added sensation of heaviness and weakness in your left arm is a major red flag that cannot be dismissed as just another migraine. Since you've experienced this with a different presentation, you need a professional to assess the neurological changes immediately. Do not rely on ibuprofen or waiting; please call emergency services or have someone drive you to the nearest urgent care or ER right now.",
