    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i hear you, but my husband says it's probably just stress and the arm thing is just because i'm tensing up from the pain. i really don't want to go if i don't have to. if i just take a double dose of my migraine meds and lay down in a dark room for a bit, is there any way i can tell if it's actually a stroke or if it's just the migraine hitting harder than usual? like what should i look for to be sure i can stay home?",
